  "historyNote": "#7940, eff 8-23-03; amd by #9641, eff 2-1-10; ss by #9975, eff 8-20-11 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Pda 500); ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19; ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19",
